    "md5": "e681f1b7e688f6c7c47e2da88664872a",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1891,
    "chunk_text": "THIS is to notify that I, Dhamma Dissanayake, Governor of the Sabaragamuwa Province has approved the By-law regarding Prevention of Public Disturbances in the Distribution of Free Food within authoritative area of Eheliyagoda Pradeshiya Sabha, prepared by the Eheliyagoda Pradeshiya Sabha by virtue of powers vested in it under Section 122 read with Section 126 of Pradeshiya Sabha Act No. 15 of 1987 and passed at its General meeting held on 25.06.2019, by virtue of powers vested under Section 123(1) of Pradeshiya Sabha Act read with Section 2 of Provincial Council (Consequential Provisions) Act No. 12 of 1989, and it will be effective within authoritative area of Eheliyagoda Pradeshiya Sabha from the date this notification is published in the Gazette. DHAMMA DISSANAYAKE, Governor, Sabaragamuwa Province. At the Sabaragamuwa Provincial Council, On this 30th day of October, 2019.\n\nBy-law on the Prevention of Public Disturbances in the Distribution of Free Food within Eheliyagoda\n\nPradeshiya Sabha Authoritative Area.\n\n1. This By-law is enacted to protect the health of the public and the associated public health in the authoritative area of the Eheliyagoda Pradeshiya Sabha.\n\n2. This By-law is known as the By-law for the Prevention of Public Persecution in the Distribution of Free Food in the Eheliyagoda Pradeshiya Sabha Authoritative Area.\n\n3. If any person, society or organization in the area of authority of the Pradeshiya Sabha intends to produce or distribute food for free distribution or supply or for any other special purpose for this purpose an application under the form specified in the first schedule of this By-law should be submitted to the Eheliyagoda Pradeshiya Sabha (Hereafter known as the PradeshiyaSabha) and obtain a license.\n\n4. The Chairman shall not issue the relevant permit unless the following conditions have been fulfilled in granting the permit."
  },
