ritative area of Kuruwita Pradeshiya Sabha.\n\n2. This by-law is known as the by-law of mobile trading of Kuruwita Pradeshiya Sabha.\n\n3.(1) No person shall sell food or any other goods in the area of authority of the Kuruwita Pradeshiya Sabha unless"
