    "chunk_size_bytes": 2012,
    "chunk_text": "I, \u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026 Medical Officer of Health of \u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026 area do hereby certify that I examined physically after a laboratory test, Mr./Mrs. \u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026 bearer of National Identity Card number \u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026.. and ensure that he/she is not suffering from any communicable disease or vector and he/she does not have any injuries, skin infections, ulcers or diarrhea that may be a threat or future threat to the food security.\n\n....................... Date ............................. Medical Officer of Health (Official Seal)\n\n12-653/1\n\n____________________________________\n\nKALAWANA PRADESHIYA SABHA\n\nTHIS is to notify that I, Dhamma Dissanayake, Governor of the Sabaragamuwa Province has approved the by-law regarding the places where Animals Are Slaughter and Kept for Slaughter within authoritative area of Kalawana Pradeshiya Sabha, prepared by the Kalawana Pradeshiya Sabha by virtue of powers vested in it under section 122 read with section 126 of Pradeshiya Sabha Act No. 15 of 1987 and passed at its general meeting held on 10.06.2019, by virtue of powers vested under section 123(1) of Pradeshiya Sabha Act read with section 2 of Provincial Council (Consequential Provisions) Act No. 12 of 1989, and it will be effective within authoritative area of Kalawana Pradeshiya Sabha from the date this notification is published in the Gazette. DHAMMA DISSANAYAKE, Governor, Sabaragamuwa Province. At the Sabaragamuwa Provincial Council, On this 30th day of October, 2019.\n\nBy-law on the places where Animals Are Slaughter and Kept for Slaughter in the Kalawana Pradeshiya\n\nSabha Authoritative Area\n\n1. This By-law is enacted to regulate, administer and standardize the places where animals are slaughtered and kept for slaughter in Kalawana Pradeshiya Sabha Authoritative Area.\n\n2. This by-law is known as the by-law on the places where animals are slaughtered and kept for slaughter in Kalawana Pradeshiya Sabha Authoritative Area."
