    "chunk_text": "........................ Date: - Signature of the applicant -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nFor office use\n\nRevenue Inspector,\n\n................... Date -: Secretary -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nSecretary,\n\nRecommended/not recommended issuing license\n\n......................... Date -: Revenue Inspector -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n45A IV(\u0d85) \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba - 2019.12.05 PART IV(A) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 05.12.2019\n\nMedical Officer of Health\n\nPlease kindly request that your observations and recommendations for the issuance of a commercial license be issued promptly.\n\n...................... Date: - Secretary -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nMedical Officer of Health\n\nComply with by-laws and other rules and regulations I will report for issuing license\n\n........................ Date: - Public Health Inspector -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nSecretary,\n\nI recommend issuing a license for the relevant place as per above application. (If not recommended, state the reason.)\n\n........................... Date: - Medical Officer of Healt