rdance with the conditions laid down by the Medical Officer of Health,\n\nthe Public Health Inspector with the approval of the Pradeshiya Sabha, when the Licensee has a disposal facility.\n\n6.(35) Every person dealing with the use of food related to the premises should ensure that the area health officer is"
