    "chunk_size_bytes": 2056,
    "chunk_text": "The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2152/42 - 2019 \u0dd9\u0daf\u0dc3\u0dd0\u023c\u0db6\u0259 \u0db8\u0dc3 05 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u022f\u0dc4\u0dc3\u0dca\u0db4\u01af\u01e6\u0daf\u0dcf - 2019.12.05\n\nNo. 2152/42 \u2013 THURSDAY, DECEMBER 05, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nGODAKAWELA PRADESHIYA SABHA\n\nBy-Law regarding Maintenance of Dangerous and Unpleasant business\n\nTHIS is to notify that I, Dhamma Dissanayake, Governor of the Sabaragamuwa Province has approved the By-law regarding maintenance of Dangerous, Unpleasant, Dangerous and Unpleasant business within authoritative area of Godakawela Pradeshiya Sabha, prepared by the Godakawela Pradeshiya Sabha by virtue of powers vested in it under Section 122 read with section 126 of Pradeshiya Sabha Act No. 15 of 1987 and passed at its general meeting held on 13.06.2019, by virtue of powers vested under section 123(1) of Pradeshiya Sabha Act read with Section 2 of Provincial Council (Consequential Provisions) Act No. 12 of 1989, and it will be effective within authoritative area of Godakawela Pradeshiya Sabha from the date this notification is published in the Gazette. DHAMMA DISSANAYAKE, Governor, Sabaragamuwa Province. At the Sabaragamuwa Provincial Council, On this 30th day of October, 2019.\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART IV (A) - PROVINCIAL COUNCILS\n\nProvincial Council Notifications\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A PG 4794 - 20 (2019/12)\n\n2 A IV(\u0d85) \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba - 2019.12.05 PART IV(A) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 05.12.2019\n\nBy-law on Dangerous, Unpleasant, Dangerous and Unpleasant business operated within the area of\n\nauthority of Godakawela Pradeshiya Sabha\n\n1. This By-Law is enacted to regulate, administrate and control businesses which are in the area of the Godakawela Pradeshiya Sabha."
  },
